"Avowed is the proper name for people the System has chosen."
"New Avowed get a class and first skills; skills of enormous power are rare for them."
"An Avowed sees System notices in peripheral vision and works them by mental command."
"Accurate mental commands are hard, so some Avowed prod the air with their fingers instead."
"The interface is dark golden light that blooms from a single point."
"It is dismissed with an open-palmed swipe, less cell phone than window washer."
"Each Avowed picks a spoken access phrase; common ones are online, call and access."
"Hands-free triggers such as eye movements help when exhausted, gagged or bound."
"Avowed almost always marry other Avowed."
"An incoming voice call shows as a light at the bottom right; 'Accept call' answers it."
"The System meets an Avowed in an endless white hallway; the room behind its door comes from memory."
"There the System appears as a featureless white mannequin with oval hands."
"Lying to contracted Avowed is expensive for the System; refusing to reveal a truth is free."
"The System will not share information about other Avowed or anything causing global catastrophe."
"Saying 'My profile' shows one's full Avowed profile to others."
